# MiroNext Platform

This project spans **3 repos** — but **work only in the current repo by default**.

## Scope rule (important)

- **Default:** edit/read **only the repo you are in** (cwd or active workspace folder). Do NOT open, search, or change other repos unless asked.
- **Cross-repo:** only when the user **explicitly** says so — e.g. "client رو هم آپدیت کن", "هر سه ریپو", "cross-repo", or they run `/platform-context`.
- Knowing the map below is for orientation — not permission to touch other repos.

