## Production

- API: `https://api.mironext.com/api/v1`
- Swagger: `/api/docs`
- Client: `https://mironext.com`
- WebSocket: Socket.IO `/ws`

## Boundaries

- **server** owns API, DB, signals, payments — no UI
- **client** owns user-facing Nuxt app — no direct DB
- **admin** owns operator React panel — uses admin API routes

## Cross-repo changes (only when user asks)

1. Change server DTO/endpoint first + tests
2. Update client and/or admin API consumers
3. Sync WebSocket handlers if events changed

**Risk: CRITICAL** — verify financial math before claiming done.
